  "description": "The Tracker 2 Step Through is your ultimate adventure companion, built for taking you places you have never been before.\nPower and control are at the heart of everything the Tracker 2 Step Through does. Equipped with a 750w motor and 16.75AH battery the power is always there. Giving you control is a combination of a torque sensing bottom bracket and thumb throttle. The torque sensor really helps to give a natural feel to the ride and when the legs are tired the throttle gives all the go with none of the effort.\nTackling treacherous terrain is the Trackers home turf. 4.0” wide tyres give you the grip you need on soft and rocky terrain transferring all the motors power where it’s needed. Combined with the suspension fork they make for a super smooth and controlled ride.\nTektro HD-M275 hydraulic disc brakes provide impressive stopping power with plenty of modulation, making tricky descents and technical sections feel relaxed. Wide range Shimano 9 speed Cues rapid fire shifting makes changing gears a breeze keeping your concentration on the trail.\nFinished with front and rear mudguards, rear rack, and kickstand, the tracker really is the complete adventure eBike. Charge it up and see where it takes you!\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
